    "Use Kafka consumer offset API for efficient fetch from given offsets in the source module.",
    "Use GitHub Pages with static HTML/Markdown (e.g., Jekyll) to organize collateral.",
    "Use Jenkins or equivalent CI to schedule Windows builds on Windows-based EC2 AMIs.",
    "For the pluggable SPI POC, use a lightweight Java ServiceLoader-style abstraction within XD runtime.",
    "Performance measurement will use custom metrics in the sink module and standard Kafka perf tools."
